Commemorative trophies designed and developed for Huspy's annual gala. Each trophy's form comes from a map of Dubai, computationally modified into a sculptural geometry, then printed in high-quality resin and assembled.

I worked with the client continuously through the design process, incorporating their reviews at each stage before delivering the final trophies.

The base of the trophy is a special granite marble that was exported to Madrid to make sure the aesthetic is inline with what the design team requested.
